//! Listing the commands here turns on Tauri's access control for them: a command must be
//! listed here *and* allowed in the window's capability (`capabilities/main.json`), or the
//! web view can't call it. tauri-build writes one permission file per command into
//! `permissions/autogenerated/` (gitignored; made again on every build). Keep this list in
//! step with `tauri::generate_handler!` in `src/app.rs`; a test there compares the two,
